  "classification": "Implemented Source public-flow correction; existing durable settlement boundaries preserved; broader financial/provider/socket/native/retail and overall Goal remain open",
  "behavior": [
    "All five parsed real-Player synchronous fallback routes capture Game-owned rejected reply retention after durable refusal and before invoking legacy settlement.",
    "Original typed callbacks serve durable and fallback routes. Auction countdown and commodity FILETIME snapshot semantics stay in existing concrete adapters.",
    "Failed result enqueue waits on the original actor queue and retries a fresh payload; Player/session/account/queue/registry/logout guards remain the existing ones. Financial operations are not re-executed.",
    "Successful fallback replies keep their immediate single send; nonreal Player/nonconcrete manager compatibility keeps its direct path."
